Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 12:39:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let the PAWtastic Games hub use the game API (Weekly
 Challenge, leaderboard, Shop)

The hub plays a copy of Graduation Day from its own address. Three hub addresses may now
call /api/public/game/* from a browser (CORS, src/lib/game/hub.ts); staff routes and the
Stripe webhook stay closed to them. A purchase started in the hub returns to
<hub>/graduation; purchases on this site return to /play/index.html as before, and
approvedOrigin is unchanged. Sign-in stays a bearer token, never a cookie.

